Eureka ships these models inside its installer, for reading scanned PDFs and
photos of printed text on this PC (OCR):

PaddleOCR models: PP-OCRv6_det_small (text detection), ch_ppocr_mobile_v2.0_cls
(text line orientation), latin_PP-OCRv5_rec_mobile (Latin text recognition)
  Copyright (c) PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
  ONNX conversions published by RapidAI (RapidOCR v3.10.0), unmodified:
  https://www.modelscope.cn/models/RapidAI/RapidOCR

RapidOCR, Copyright (c) RapidAI. Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR
  Eureka's OCR pre- and post-processing (src-tauri/src/ocr.rs) is a Rust port of
  RapidOCR's (detector resize, DB post-processing, crops, classifier, CTC decoding).

Software linked into Eureka for local speech:
