Software linked into Eureka for reading Word, PowerPoint, EPUB and OpenDocument
files in the library (src-tauri/src/office.rs):
  anydoc, Copyright (c) 2026 Sideguide Technologies Inc. (Firecrawl). MIT License.
  https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc
